<title>USA: Advanced Health enters pact with HIP.</title>
<headline>Advanced Health enters pact with HIP.</headline>
<dateline>TARRYTOWN, N.Y. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Health Corp said on Monday that it has entered an agreement to manage orthopedic specialty care for HIP Health Plan of New Jersey's 202,000 members.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Advanced Health is a physician practice and network management firm.</p>
